Browser Host Examples
===============================================================================

Browser-oriented project examples and guides live under `examples` and `docs`.

1. Browser project
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```text
examples/analog-clock/
```

The analog clock is the maintained native/browser project example. It uses the time, console, and scene hosts.

2. Static bundle project
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```text
examples/browser-dom-demo/
```

The browser DOM demo is the executable static bundle example. It configures browser DOM paths and grants, and its shim uses static-compatible relative URLs.

Guide:

```text
/docs/guides/first-web-bundle.mec
```
